    <item>
      <title>NH casino industry hits half-billion dollars a year</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-12/nh-casinos-gambling-industry-gaming-newhampshire</link>
      <description>The biggest gambling winners are the casino game room operators themselves, which took in $250 million in 2025 from horse racing and games of chance alone, with video lottery games on track to generate $75 million a year. Casino betting in New Hampshire is generating half a billion dollars a year in revenue.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-12/nh-casinos-gambling-industry-gaming-newhampshire</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/8d5ce2f/2147483647/strip/false/crop/1366x768+0+0/resize/300x169!/quality/90/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa7%2F4c%2F0538d44c499388ba7a5b4486f333%2Fnash-casino-nhpr-photo-kate-dario-050825-1.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
