      <title>Manchester-Boston Regional Airport sees record cargo and an uptick in passengers</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-12/manchester-boston-regional-airport-mht-record-cargo-uptick-in-passengers</link>
      <description>Manchester-Boston Regional Airport, aka MHT, saw the highest cargo volumes ever recorded with 238 million pounds of cargo in 2025, which is 4 million pounds more than the previous record set in 2023.</description>
